<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
    <title>{@title} · Trays</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href={~p"/legal/legal.css"} />
  </head>
  <body class="legal">
    <div class="legal-shell">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <a class="legal-brand" href="/">Trays</a>
        <span class="legal-meta">Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information</span>
      </div>
      <article class="legal-content">
        <h1>Advertising Choices</h1>

        <p>
          <strong>
            <%= if @opted_out do %>
              You are opted out of advertising-related cookies.
            <% else %>
              No opt-out preference is set.
            <% end %>
          </strong>
        </p>

        <p>
          Trays sets no advertising cookies today. The website may show clearly
          labeled sponsored placements, but they are first-party house content
          and do not track you. This page exists so that if third-party
          advertising is ever introduced, your choice is already recorded and
          honored.
        </p>

        <p>
          If you opt out, the only thing stored is a single preference cookie
          named <code>trays_ads_opt_out</code>. It contains no identifier — its
          value is the literal <code>1</code> — and it is never used for
          tracking. It simply tells your browser not to load advertising
          scripts on trays.app.
        </p>

        <p>
          Browsers that send the Global Privacy Control signal are honored
          automatically, with no cookie required.
        </p>

        <form method="post" action={~p"/privacy/ads-choices"}>
          <input
            type="hidden"
            name="_csrf_token"
            value={Phoenix.Controller.get_csrf_token()}
          />
          <%= if @opted_out do %>
            <input type="hidden" name="choice" value="opt_in" />
            <button type="submit">Remove my opt-out preference</button>
          <% else %>
            <input type="hidden" name="choice" value="opt_out" />
            <button type="submit">Opt out of advertising cookies</button>
          <% end %>
        </form>

        <p>
          <a href={~p"/privacy"}>Back to the Privacy Policy</a>
        </p>
      </article>
      <div class="legal-footer">
        <p>1001366752 Ontario Inc. · <a href="mailto:support@trays.app">support@trays.app</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
